TEXT -80 152 Left 2 ;Switches at current zero leads to voltage at line capacitances\nis maximal, one at near 300kV and two at near -350kV/-400kV\nSum is near 400kV and not zero !!!!!\nIf this switcher is used in isolated star point circuits it can lead to a\nvoltage system with offset\nsee voltage_offset.asc and Voltage_offset2.asc and Test_Fuses.asc
